      "comment" : "Explanation in Settings > AI of how to ask for a command suggestion. Keep the # and ?? characters."
    },
    "Type a command, or open the palette to change the intensity, search your history or open a folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
